00:11:05,067 --> 00:11:08,167
alam naman niya na nagpapanggap
lang naman tayong lahat, 'di ba?

235
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:11,500
Aba'y dapat pigilan niya,

236
00:11:11,633 --> 00:11:14,133
dahil siya maaagrabyado
kapag bumalik na nga

237
00:11:14,267 --> 00:11:16,500
-'yong alaala ni Gloria!
-Ay, sigurado 'yan.

238
00:11:16,633 --> 00:11:17,800
Paano ba gagawin natin?

239
00:11:17,933 --> 00:11:20,700
E, dapat naman kasi,
hindi na tayo pumayag, e!

240
00:11:22,133 --> 00:11:23,367
Bahala na.

241
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:25,467
[MAPANGLAW NA MUSIKA]

242
00:11:28,367 --> 00:11:30,433
Ako na 'to.
Ako na magliligpit niyan.

243
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,067
Siya nga pala, mamaya, ha?

244
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,800
Magpractice na tayo
noong para sa interview mo.

245
00:11:35,933 --> 00:11:36,967
Practice?

246
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:39,367
Nako, hindi ko na
kailangan 'yon.

247
00:11:39,500 --> 00:11:40,467
Ako pa!

248
00:11:40,733 --> 00:11:42,567
Kayang-kayang ko
sagutin lahat 'yan.

249
00:11:42,933 --> 00:11:45,100
Mga teacher ko nga,
hindi umuubra sa 'kin, e.

250
00:11:45,233 --> 00:11:46,200
[NATAWA SI GABO]

251
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:48,833
Ako na maghuhugas nito.

252
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:55,067
[MAHINAHONG MUSIKA]

253
00:12:11,633 --> 00:12:13,400
Ituturo ko sa inyo.
Makinig kayo, ha?

254
00:12:13,533 --> 00:12:16,367
'Pag dumating na ang customer,

255
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:18,500
papaupuin ninyo,

256
00:12:18,633 --> 00:12:20,633
itatable ninyo,

257
00:12:20,767 --> 00:12:22,800
bibigyan niyo ng inumin.

258
00:12:22,933 --> 00:12:27,700
Siyempre, lalambing-lambingin.

259
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,067
'Di ba?

260
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:32,533
Tapos, paganiyan-ganiyan.

261
00:12:32,667 --> 00:12:35,167
Kunyari, gaganiyan-ganiyan.

262
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:37,700
'Pag nakalingat na sila,

263
00:12:37,833 --> 00:12:42,767
ito na ang tamang oras,
ilagay niyo 'to

264
00:12:43,633 --> 00:12:46,767
E, ano naman pong epekto
sa kanila niyan, madam?

265
00:12:46,900 --> 00:12:48,367
E, 'di, makakatulog.

266
00:12:49,167 --> 00:12:53,067
At kapag nakatulog na,
mag-order na kayo

267
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:56,733
ng kahit na anong ladies' drink,

268
00:12:56,867 --> 00:13:00,267
kahit na anong pulutan, lahat,

269
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:02,033
para paggising nila,

270
00:13:02,167 --> 00:13:04,833
[SUMINGHAP]
ang dami nilang babayaran.

271
00:13:04,967 --> 00:13:06,967
-Klaro?
-Yes, madam!

272
00:13:07,100 --> 00:13:09,600
Very good!

273
00:13:09,733 --> 00:13:10,700
O.

274
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:17,300
-Katable niyo.
-Betchay...

275
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:20,367
Mukhang may humahabol pang
mag-aaudition, a?

276
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:22,333
-Ha?
-Mag-aapply ka ng GRO?

277
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:23,567
Puwedeng-puwede!

278
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:25,167
Oy, oy, oy! Shh! Shh!

279
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:26,400
Kilala ko 'yan.

280
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:27,900
[UMAAWIT SI ROMY]

281
00:13:28,033 --> 00:13:30,200
[ROMY]
Sampolan niyo naman! 'Yan!

282
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,333
[PAQUITO] O, sample!

283
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:36,567
[UMAAWIT]

284
00:13:40,367 --> 00:13:41,667
[BETCHAY] Walang-hiya ka!

285
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:44,367
Ako pa? Ako pa lolokohin mo?

286
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:47,967
Hoy, may marunong magbasa
ng Ingles sa bahay namin!

287
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:49,533
Kaya mag-ingat ka, ha?

288
00:13:49,667 --> 00:13:53,167
Dahil kapag hindi na kita
pinalabas dito, patay ka!

289
00:13:57,567 --> 00:14:01,000
Ikaw ang kailangan mag-ingat,
dahil taga-NLEA ako.

290
00:14:01,333 --> 00:14:03,100
Sabi ko na nga ba,
niloloko mo 'ko!

291
00:14:03,233 --> 00:14:06,033
-Sabi mo, taga-NGO ka?
-O, huminahon ka. Shh...

292
00:14:06,167 --> 00:14:07,600
[NAKABABAHALANG MUSIKA]

293
00:14:07,733 --> 00:14:09,067
Ibaba mo 'yang hawak mo.

294
00:14:09,667 --> 00:14:11,733
-Ayan, nakababa na.
-Huminahon ka.

295
00:14:11,867 --> 00:14:14,667
Hindi ka kayang iligtas
ng mga kasama mo dito, misis.

296
00:14:15,867 --> 00:14:18,167
Okay? Mahinahon na?
Puwede na tayo mag-usap?

297
00:14:18,300 --> 00:14:19,267
[BETCHAY] Mm-hmm!

298
00:14:21,667 --> 00:14:22,667
[HUMINGHAY]

299
00:14:23,533 --> 00:14:25,500
[NAKABABAHALANG MUSIKA]

300
00:14:28,067 --> 00:14:29,200
Misis!

301
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:34,067
Kailangan kasi ng mga Jacinto
'yong property nila.

302
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,167
Kanila 'yon.

303
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:36,533
Kailangan?

304
00:14:36,667 --> 00:14:37,733
[UMISMID SI BETCHAY]

305
00:14:37,967 --> 00:14:38,933
Ano ang kapalit?

306
00:14:39,067 --> 00:14:40,533
'Yong lupa namin?

307
00:14:40,667 --> 00:14:42,600
Hoy, ang hirap ng pinapagawa mo!

308
00:14:43,133 --> 00:14:44,667
Dadagdagan ko
'yong bigay ko sa 'yo.

309
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:46,333
Uy, hindi ako mukhang pera, ha!

310
00:14:46,467 --> 00:14:49,600
Niloko mo na ako minsan,
magpapaloko na naman ako sa 'yo?

311
00:14:51,367 --> 00:14:54,000
Pasensiya na ulit, ha?
Nagpanggap akong taga-NGO,

312
00:14:54,133 --> 00:14:55,800
pero ginawa ko lang 'yon
para makausap kayo,

313
00:14:55,933 --> 00:14:57,267
para matulungan kayo.

314
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,367
Kita niyo naman, lahat naman,
binigay ko sa inyo.

315
00:15:00,933 --> 00:15:03,200
O, ngayon, alam niyo
na taga-NLEA ako.

316
00:15:03,367 --> 00:15:05,467
'Di ba, dapat mas lalo niyo
akong pagkatiwalaan?

317
00:15:06,667 --> 00:15:08,933
Handa ako magbigay
ng mas mataas na offer.

318
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:10,900
Kahit magkano.

319
00:15:12,033 --> 00:15:13,000
Magkano?

320
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:14,500
Isang milyon.

321
00:15:17,100 --> 00:15:19,233
Papirmahan niyo lang
'tong dokumento na 'to.

322
00:15:19,367 --> 00:15:21,467
Kailangan, may katibayan.

323
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,167
Ayan ka na naman sa pruweba, e!

324
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:25,400
Napakadali naman
ng pruwebang hinihingi ko!

325
00:15:25,533 --> 00:15:28,533
Kailangan ko lang
ng picture o video

326
00:15:28,667 --> 00:15:30,867
na pinipirmahan niya
'tong dokumento,

327
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,067
na walang pumipilit sa kaniya.

328
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,600
Ganoon lang.
Napakasimple, 'di ba?

329
00:15:33,733 --> 00:15:35,700
Uutakan mo na naman ako, e.

330
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:38,233
Bahala kayo, misis.

331
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,033
Isang milyon 'yan.

332
00:15:40,167 --> 00:15:42,100
[TENSIYONADONG MUSIKA]

333
00:15:42,233 --> 00:15:44,433
'Yan ang makapagbabago
sa buhay niyo.

334
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:47,167
E, paano 'yon?

335
00:15:49,433 --> 00:15:50,400
Sa 'yo na din.

336
00:15:51,233 --> 00:15:53,200
[NAKABABAHALANG MUSIKA]

337
00:15:56,133 --> 00:15:57,700
Ano? May usapan ba tayo?

338
00:16:01,733 --> 00:16:03,133
Ipapabasa ko 'to.

339
00:16:04,267 --> 00:16:05,333
Aasahan ko 'yan.

340
00:16:05,733 --> 00:16:07,700
[TENSIYONADONG MUSIKA]

341
00:16:17,367 --> 00:16:18,667
[KUMUKULILING ANG PHONE]

342
00:16:21,333 --> 00:16:22,200
Sir.

343
00:16:22,333 --> 00:16:24,167
Teniente Jacinto,
where are you now?

344
00:16:24,300 --> 00:16:26,600
Pasensiya na ho kayo,
may inutos lang po si Dad.

345
00:16:26,733 --> 00:16:27,733
Yes, sir?

346
00:16:27,867 --> 00:16:30,633
Pupunta ako ng NCIA.
I want you to meet me there.

347
00:16:30,767 --> 00:16:32,667
They have an update
about your sister.

348
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:33,867
Ano ho 'yon?

349
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:36,633
I don't have the full
details yet, Teniente Jacinto.

350
00:16:36,967 --> 00:16:39,767
Si Delgado na lang ang
magsasabi sa atin doon, okay?

351
00:16:39,900 --> 00:16:41,533
Okay, sir. I'll see you there.

352
00:16:43,133 --> 00:16:44,167
[GLORIA] Tiyang?

353
00:16:46,433 --> 00:16:47,733
Papasama lang po sana ako.

354
00:16:47,867 --> 00:16:49,267
Bibili ako ng biodata, e.

355
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:50,800
Ay, oo! Siya, sige, o.

356
00:16:51,233 --> 00:16:53,200
Ipasok mo na muna 'yan.
Samahan ko muna 'yong bata.

357
00:16:53,433 --> 00:16:55,233
-Sige. Halika na!
-Una na po kami.

358
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:58,567
Seryoso siya, 'no?

359
00:16:58,700 --> 00:17:00,000
[NATAWA] Oo nga po, e.

360
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:01,267
Nako!

361
00:17:01,933 --> 00:17:03,033
Totohanan na!

362
00:17:03,167 --> 00:17:06,733
Si Gloria, bibili ng biodata!

363
00:17:06,867 --> 00:17:08,367
[TAWANAN]

364
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:09,467
E, Tiyong...

365
00:17:09,767 --> 00:17:11,133
Nakakatawa nga, e.

366
00:17:11,433 --> 00:17:12,533
Alam niyo,

367
00:17:12,967 --> 00:17:14,967
mas si Gloria pa nga ang
kinakabahan kaysa sa 'kin, e.

368
00:17:15,133 --> 00:17:16,400
-[TAWANAN]
-Pero...

369
00:17:16,533 --> 00:17:17,833
Pero, anak, ha? Payo lang naman.

370
00:17:17,967 --> 00:17:19,300
Seryosohin mo 'yan, ha?

371
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:23,600
Tsaka kailangan,
lahat ng sasabihin mo, totoo.

372
00:17:23,867 --> 00:17:26,900
Kasi malamang,
'yong mag-iinterview sa 'yo,

373
00:17:27,033 --> 00:17:28,200
de-kalidad 'yan.

374
00:17:28,533 --> 00:17:29,700
Kagaya ni Gloria.

375
00:17:29,833 --> 00:17:33,700
Matalino, matalim,
at saka matapang.

376
00:17:34,167 --> 00:17:35,767
Baka naman diyan ka pa
sumablay, ha?

377
00:17:35,900 --> 00:17:36,867
E, Tay...

378
00:17:38,067 --> 00:17:39,967
Ganoon ba talaga kaseryoso
'pag iniinterview?

379
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:41,433
[DANTE] Basta ang isipin mo,

380
00:17:41,567 --> 00:17:43,000
kung ganoon kadali
'yong interview,

381
00:17:43,133 --> 00:17:44,967
e, 'di, lahat sana, may trabaho!

382
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:46,200
Tama ka diyan!

383
00:17:46,333 --> 00:17:47,800
Basta, anak, tandaan mo lang.

384
00:17:47,933 --> 00:17:50,500
Wala namang mawawala kung
magiging seryoso ka, 'di ba?

385
00:17:50,667 --> 00:17:51,567
Parang lang...

386
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:53,067
nagtatayo ka ng pamilya.

387
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,700
Kailangan, kilalanin mo.

388
00:17:54,833 --> 00:17:56,167
Alamin mo 'yong tao.

389
00:17:56,600 --> 00:18:00,267
At higit sa lahat,
dapat maging tapat ka, 'di ba?

390
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,967
Seryoso naman talaga ako, e.

391
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:05,100
Saka... pinapangako ko sa inyo,

392
00:18:05,233 --> 00:18:07,667
seseryosohin ko bukas
'yong pag-aapply ko ng trabaho.

393
00:18:08,067 --> 00:18:09,967
Para kahit papaano,

394
00:18:10,467 --> 00:18:11,833
maipagmamalaki ako ni Gloria

395
00:18:11,967 --> 00:18:13,433
'pag may maganda na
akong trabaho.

396
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:15,933
[TAWANAN]

397
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:18,867
Thank you.

398
00:18:19,267 --> 00:18:20,233
Sir.

399
00:18:20,567 --> 00:18:22,333
-Hi.
-Bakit po tayo nandito?

400
00:18:23,633 --> 00:18:24,633
Teniente Jacinto,

401
00:18:24,767 --> 00:18:26,800
I did not want to tell you
over the phone,

402
00:18:26,933 --> 00:18:29,800
pero nahanap nila
ang jacket ng kapatid mo.

403
00:18:29,933 --> 00:18:31,900
[DRAMATIKONG MUSIKA]

404
00:18:35,733 --> 00:18:37,700
Buti, naabutan pa nating bukas.

405
00:18:37,833 --> 00:18:38,733
Oo nga po, e.

406
00:18:38,867 --> 00:18:40,333
Handa na kaya si Gabo?

407
00:18:40,467 --> 00:18:41,433
-Nako!
-[NATAWA PAREHO]

408
00:18:41,567 --> 00:18:43,800
'Yon pa,
mukhang excited na takot.

409
00:18:44,367 --> 00:18:45,733
Buti, nakumbinsi mo.

410
00:18:45,867 --> 00:18:47,100
Oo nga po, e.

411
00:18:47,233 --> 00:18:49,200
[MAHINAHONG MUSIKA]

412
00:18:52,033 --> 00:18:53,000
Gabo!

413
00:18:54,433 --> 00:18:55,467
[DANTE] Ayan na.

414
00:18:55,633 --> 00:18:56,533
Ready?

415
00:18:56,667 --> 00:18:58,433
[NATAWA] Ako pa!

416
00:18:58,567 --> 00:18:59,533
Ready!

417
00:19:00,033 --> 00:19:01,300
Let's get it on!

418
00:19:02,033 --> 00:19:04,433
-[TAWANAN]
-'Yan ang anak ko, ha!

419
00:19:06,733 --> 00:19:08,700
[NAKABABAHALANG MUSIKA]

420
00:19:10,367 --> 00:19:11,800
Director Delgado.

421
00:19:14,133 --> 00:19:15,100
Sir.

422
00:19:21,967 --> 00:19:24,200
Ano po ang balita
sa imbestigasyon ninyo?

423
00:19:26,267 --> 00:19:27,233
Max...

424
00:19:28,867 --> 00:19:33,333
Nahanap namin
'yong jacket ni Sam sa ilog.

425
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,433
Tadtad ng bala.

426
00:19:35,967 --> 00:19:37,933
[DRAMATIKONG MUSIKA]

427
00:19:48,767 --> 00:19:51,800
[DELGADO] Nakausap ko na
'yong mga parents mo, Max.

428
00:19:52,567 --> 00:19:55,167
Nasabi ko na sa kanila
kung ano ang nangyari.

429
00:20:02,633 --> 00:20:05,067
Sinadya niyo talagang
hindi sabihan ang NLEA.

430
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:07,400
May usapan tayo, Fernando.

431
00:20:08,033 --> 00:20:10,133
Not the case, Romulo.

432
00:20:10,867 --> 00:20:14,133
Si General Jacinto
ang kailangang unang-unang

433
00:20:14,267 --> 00:20:16,567
dapat makaalam ng nangyari.

434
00:20:20,067 --> 00:20:22,033
[DRAMATIKONG MUSIKA]

435
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:39,033
[DRAMATIKONG MUSIKA]

436
00:20:39,167 --> 00:20:40,300
It's just a...

437
00:20:40,633 --> 00:20:41,800
a jacket!

438
00:20:43,933 --> 00:20:45,300
With holes.

439
00:20:47,233 --> 00:20:48,767
Doesn't prove anything.

440
00:20:51,767 --> 00:20:54,200
Naconfirm ng
forensics team namin

441
00:20:54,867 --> 00:20:56,800
na kay Sam nga
ang jacket na 'yan.

442
00:20:57,067 --> 00:20:58,200
[SEB] Which...

443
00:20:58,667 --> 00:21:01,833
most likely means na
noong gabing tinambangan siya,

444
00:21:01,967 --> 00:21:04,033
inabutan talaga siya
ng mga masasamang loob.

445
00:21:04,167 --> 00:21:05,267
[TENSIYONADONG MUSIKA]

446
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:07,800
Pinatay siya, Max.

447
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,167
We're sorry.

448
00:21:12,033 --> 00:21:13,000
Patay?

449
00:21:15,033 --> 00:21:16,833
Bakit? May nakita ba
kayong bangkay?

450
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:18,767
Wala!

451
00:21:21,933 --> 00:21:23,233
Buhay ang kapatid ko.

452
00:21:26,467 --> 00:21:27,500
Buhay siya.

453
00:21:27,633 --> 00:21:29,600
[TENSIYONADONG MUSIKA]

454
00:21:38,233 --> 00:21:39,233
Hi po.

455
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:43,633
May dumating daw
na taga-NLEA dito?

456
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:44,867
Yes, ma'am.

457
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:48,033
Para po sa joint investigation
natin sa kasong Jacinto.

458
00:21:48,433 --> 00:21:50,500
Andiyan nga po
'yong mismong kapatid, e.

459
00:21:52,500 --> 00:21:55,367
Pinahanap na namin sa retrieval
team 'yong katawan ni Sam.

460
00:21:55,667 --> 00:21:56,667
But...

461
00:21:57,667 --> 00:21:58,633
to no avail.

462
00:21:59,933 --> 00:22:02,967
Dahil sa lakas na agos ng tubig
nitong mga nakaraang araw,

463
00:22:03,733 --> 00:22:06,300
posibleng umabot na
ang katawan niya sa Manila Bay.

464
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:08,867
Wala nga kayong
makikitang bangkay,

465
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:10,733
dahil buhay 'yong kapatid ko!

466
00:22:11,133 --> 00:22:14,100
As if hindi niyo alam
'yong kapasidad ng kapatid ko!

467
00:22:15,167 --> 00:22:16,300
Alam niyo 'yan!

468
00:22:16,567 --> 00:22:18,533
Hindi namin kinukuwestiyon

469
00:22:18,667 --> 00:22:21,133
ang kakayahan
ng kapatid mo, Max.

470
00:22:21,700 --> 00:22:25,667
Pero sa nangyari sa kaniya,
walang mabubuhay.

471
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:27,700
Buhay ang kapatid ko!

472
00:22:28,167 --> 00:22:29,433
